Kit-specific always-on supplement. Full prime directives, orchestration, model routing, and human gates: kit root [CLAUDE.md](../../CLAUDE.md). Operator map: [CLAUDE-FLOW.md](../../CLAUDE-FLOW.md). Scope: [KIT-SCOPE.md](../../KIT-SCOPE.md).

## Command spine (12 shipped)

```
/generate-brd → /propose-architecture → /plan-sprint
 → /generate-ui-design + /implement-api → /implement-ui
